{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ars Notoria is an <strong>open-world survival crafting game</strong> set in a rich fantasy world. Blending classic gameplay elements like <strong>building</strong>,<strong> crafting</strong>, and <strong>survival</strong>, it invites you on a journey filled with wonder, mystery, and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture out alone or team up with friends to explore a land full of secrets and danger. Build your base, gather resources, expand your influence, and stand against the ever-shifting threat of the Enthralled. Whether you prefer to go solo or fight alongside allies, the game delivers a complete and rewarding experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Halloween, the world of Ars Notoria takes on a darker, spookier edge with the arrival of the <strong>Festival of Souls</strong>. Mysterious events, unique quests, and fearsome new foes await adventurers bold enough to face the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/92763f35d9e921e241f652ea6d8b5cc2.poster.avif?t=1761122711\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/92763f35d9e921e241f652ea6d8b5cc2.webm?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/92763f35d9e921e241f652ea6d8b5cc2.mp4?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc7b Halloween in Ars Notoria</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first seven days of Aur, the Season of Harvest returns, shrouding the land in an eerie glow. Enemies grow more numerous and relentless, and Ars Necromia, the magic of chaos and necromancy, swells with formidable power. Adventurers must face these rising threats or risk being overwhelmed by the darkness.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront abominations shaped by the Enthralled curse, where even the simplest harvest symbols are twisted into monstrous forms by dark spirits and foul magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/82e4f6b8cde58ab8e4e91a959e6664cb.poster.avif?t=1761122711\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/82e4f6b8cde58ab8e4e91a959e6664cb.webm?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/82e4f6b8cde58ab8e4e91a959e6664cb.mp4?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore tombs, cemeteries, and haunted ruins where newly risen undead grow stronger under the Festival\u2019s dark influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/4514604143e7080ae00c340787e4c540.poster.avif?t=1761122711\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/4514604143e7080ae00c340787e4c540.webm?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/4514604143e7080ae00c340787e4c540.mp4?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in the Festival of Souls, a kingdom-wide event where remembrance intersects with hidden threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/2e2244c5bde7bc9692bd33ad5ea77f9c.poster.avif?t=1761122711\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/2e2244c5bde7bc9692bd33ad5ea77f9c.webm?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/2e2244c5bde7bc9692bd33ad5ea77f9c.mp4?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft new structures, accessories, and recipes, including items introduced with the festival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/bc18a17ed5a51489a4c706c8e54263d6.poster.avif?t=1761122711\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/bc18a17ed5a51489a4c706c8e54263d6.webm?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/bc18a17ed5a51489a4c706c8e54263d6.mp4?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These events are a <strong>permanent part of the game world</strong>, returning every cycle of Aur for players to enjoy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vast World, Survival Evolved</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dangerous open world filled with forests, fields, dungeons, and more, where breathtaking landscapes shaped by magic await discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into shadowy depths and frozen caverns, traverse ancient magical ruins and the hidden lairs of bandits, confronting a wide variety of Enthralled along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face intense boss fights against colossal, corrupted creatures that threaten to bring ruin to the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/60de5df0714bb31e42d01c52581d91cd.poster.avif?t=1761122711\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/60de5df0714bb31e42d01c52581d91cd.webm?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/60de5df0714bb31e42d01c52581d91cd.mp4?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Magic, Lead Your Squad</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn six distinct schools of magic: Fire, Frost, Poison, Lightning, Chaos, and Holy. Each brings unique spells and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine magical sigils and traits to craft spells that suit your fighting style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imbue your gear with magic and elemental powers to enhance your effectiveness in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a team of adventurers with varied fighting styles, weapons, and roles. Switch between them during battle for fluid, tactical combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/3ec19d3cbcb931c0f24e551b47890911.poster.avif?t=1761122711\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/3ec19d3cbcb931c0f24e551b47890911.webm?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/3ec19d3cbcb931c0f24e551b47890911.mp4?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join Factions, Grow Your Influence</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Align yourself with various factions and rise through their ranks to expand your influence across the kingdom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign faction members to handle essential tasks like gathering resources, guarding outposts, crafting equipment, or researching new technologies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction offers unique questlines and branching narratives, with your choices shaping the future of the kingdom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/74b3efe55f535c2411d3e4cf615d0599.poster.avif?t=1761122711\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/74b3efe55f535c2411d3e4cf615d0599.webm?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/74b3efe55f535c2411d3e4cf615d0599.mp4?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Gather, Build, and Prosper</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade your base using a wide range of structures and materials. Customize patterns and colors to create your ideal refuge, fortress, or outpost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamline routine tasks with automated systems that help your settlement grow while you focus on exploration and combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use global resource storage to keep materials without overloading your inventory, and access what you need anytime, anywhere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame wild creatures or summon arcane companions using magic or skill, and gain allies that aid you in harvesting, defense, or battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/7c890b210ce0bdcad2f642bfa4405969.poster.avif?t=1761122711\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/7c890b210ce0bdcad2f642bfa4405969.webm?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/7c890b210ce0bdcad2f642bfa4405969.mp4?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adventure Together, Fight Side by Side</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In online co-op mode, team up with friends to explore the world of Ars Notoria.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the journey as you experience story quests, conquer dungeons, build a dream base, and shape your own epic tale together.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2074620?t=1761122711","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761122711","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/0395b0f0b15aa44664f78849e1c08146ce49c41d/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1761122711","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/0395b0f0b15aa44664f78849e1c08146ce49c41d/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1761122711","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player"