ameplay Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vast World, Survival Evolved</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dangerous open world filled with forests, fields, dungeons, and more, where breathtaking landscapes shaped by magic await discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into shadowy depths and frozen caverns, traverse ancient magical ruins and the hidden lairs of bandits, confronting a wide variety of Enthralled along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face intense boss fights against colossal, corrupted creatures that threaten to bring ruin to the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/60de5df0714bb31e42d01c52581d91cd.poster.avif?t=1761122711\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/60de5df0714bb31e42d01c52581d91cd.webm?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/60de5df0714bb31e42d01c52581d91cd.mp4?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Magic, Lead Your Squad</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn six distinct schools of magic: Fire, Frost, Poison, Lightning, Chaos, and Holy. Each brings unique spells and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine magical sigils and traits to craft spells that suit your fighting style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imbue your gear with magic and elemental powers to enhance your effectiveness in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a team of adventurers with varied fighting styles, weapons, and roles. Switch between them during battle for fluid, tactical combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/3ec19d3cbcb931c0f24e551b47890911.poster.avif?t=1761122711\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/3ec19d3cbcb931c0f24e551b47890911.webm?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/3ec19d3cbcb931c0f24e551b47890911.mp4?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join Factions, Grow Your Influence</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Align yourself with various factions and rise through their ranks to expand your influence across the kingdom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign faction members to handle essential tasks like gathering resources, guarding outposts, crafting equipment, or researching new technologies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction offers unique questlines and branching narratives, with your choices shaping the future of the kingdom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/74b3efe55f535c2411d3e4cf615d0599.poster.avif?t=1761122711\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/74b3efe55f535c2411d3e4cf615d0599.webm?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/74b3efe55f535c2411d3e4cf615d0599.mp4?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Gather, Build, and Prosper</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade your base using a wide range of structures and materials. Customize patterns and colors to create your ideal refuge, fortress, or outpost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamline routine tasks with automated systems that help your settlement grow while you focus on exploration and combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use global resource storage to keep materials without overloading your inventory, and access what you need anytime, anywhere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame wild creatures or summon arcane companions using magic or skill, and gain allies that aid you in harvesting, defense, or battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/7c890b210ce0bdcad2f642bfa4405969.poster.avif?t=1761122711\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/7c890b210ce0bdcad2f642bfa4405969.webm?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/7c890b210ce0bdcad2f642bfa4405969.mp4?t=1761122711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adventure Together, Fight Side by Side</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In online co-op mode, team up with friends to explore the world of Ars Notoria.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the journey as you experience story quests, conquer dungeons, build a dream base, and shape your own epic tale together.</p></li></ul>","developers":["XRON Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https